{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-4","storyName":"并蒂生","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"菈塔托丝与维多利亚大使第二次会面，暗示要解决阿克托斯这个麻烦。茱安娜与恩雅关系开始破冰，又再次遭遇刺客的袭击。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["菈塔托丝","休露丝","维多利亚大使","茱安娜","恩雅","雅儿","路过的老人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_bg_24_g8_nobleroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","channel":"kc","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"烦死了！不是和你们说过今天别再打扰我了吗？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"是谁在——","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"charslot","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......姐姐。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"你怎么来了......","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"快坐下，怎么了，睡不着吗？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"尤卡坦怎么搞的，明明叫他盯好你——","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"不......","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"她摇了摇头。","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"不，是我不让尤卡坦跟来的。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我想单独和你谈谈。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#4$1","focus":"n","id":38},{"type":"text","text":"菈塔托丝从未想过，会在这个直率开朗的妹妹脸上看到这样的神色。","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"好吧，不过只能一会，然后就去乖乖睡觉。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"真是......都是当妈妈的人了，怎么还像个小孩一样。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我今天，听到了阿克托斯在客厅里大吼大叫......","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"multiline","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"还是吵到你了？","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"multiline","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"该死的，回头必须找他算账......","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"不......不是......","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我听到了你们争论的事，我也知道这段时间，谢拉格发生了很多糟糕的事......","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"菈塔......我请求你。如果你知道些什么，一定、一定要告诉我。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"耶拉冈德在上......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"休露丝，这些都不是你现在应该操心的事。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"放心吧，等你以后接过这一大摊子事了，有的是要你操心的机会呢。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"可是，最近的变故一件接着一件，就算我一直待在房间里，也能感觉到一切都在变得很糟......","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"每天都能在窗户外面看见愁眉不展的人，还有莫希她，到现在还是一点消息都没有......","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我还在派人寻找她的下落......我相信她不会有事的，别忘了，她现在可是布朗陶家最厉害的战士之一。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我当然知道......","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"可我更担心的是你，菈塔。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"虽然以前我也不太能帮上你的什么忙，但至少还能站在你身边，给你一点支持......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"可是现在，只有你一个人应付这一切......菈塔，我还是希望你能多和我说说话。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"你不用一个人坚持什么，我和尤卡坦，在任何时候都一定会支持你的。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......你想的太多了，我的傻瓜妹妹。你是在怀疑我当不好这个家主，想要早点接班了？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"我不是——","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我向你发誓，休露丝。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我会保护好你，还有尤卡坦，以及整个布朗陶家。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"就算豁出命去，我也一定会做到。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"耶拉冈德见证，绝不食言。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"怎么，你就算不信我，还能不信耶拉冈德吗？","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_262_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休露丝","text":"没必要把话说得那么重......","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_npc_262_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"好......那你答应我，现在就去休息。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"放心吧，明天一定会比今天更好......","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_bg_45_g7_lakescenery_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":97,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","duration":"0.7","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我很荣幸收到您的邀请，尊敬的布朗陶夫人。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"您这个时候主动约见我，想必是改变主意了？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......少说废话。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"对希瓦艾什家和佩尔罗契家的人发起刺杀，离间三族关系，这就是你们逼迫我与你们合作的方式？","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"呵，我原本以为维多利亚的政治家至少会用点更聪明的手段。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"text","text":"男人不置可否地笑了笑。","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"布朗陶夫人，我不明白您为何会这样想。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"在别国境内对其领导人发起刺杀，这可是毫无疑问的宣战行为......如果被证实的话。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"您确定要对维多利亚发起这样的指控吗？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......这就是你们有恃无恐的理由。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"尊敬的夫人，恐怕我还是不明白您的意思。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"不过既然您今天选择与我见面，那我十分乐意听您讲讲——有什么是我可以为您效劳的？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......哼，得意吧，你们粗糙的计谋还是达成了目的，起码佩尔罗契和布朗陶的关系已经彻底破裂，在其他人眼里我也戴上了可疑的帽子。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"至于恩希欧迪斯......那套什么三家都想要稳定的话术，就是临时编出来骗骗阿克托斯那个傻子的。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"他心里清楚得很，以谢拉格的现状，一旦某家领袖“意外”遇害，只要有人稍微挑拨，失去最后希望的本地领民们肯定会一哄而散。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"万一我们见面的事被他知道了，就算他清楚我没有答应你们任何事情，也会毫不犹豫带着佩尔罗契向我发难。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"毕竟现在的谢拉格，急缺一位能担负所有的“罪人”。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"以他的手腕，最坏的下场，就是布朗陶家从此断绝于谢拉格。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......我的时间不多了。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我很同情您的处境，夫人。我也认为您对局势的分析一点不差。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"那么，您是否有意打破这样的局面呢？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......那我们就别废话了。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"首先，我要你们绝对的承诺——不管在任何情况下，都要优先保证布朗陶家的安全，还有领民的安全。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"当然，我们素来同情被希瓦艾什边缘化的普通本地民众，这是我们推进与谢拉格和平合作的初心之一。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"啧......随你怎么说。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"其次，将来布朗陶家接替喀兰贸易与维多利亚合作的时候，当前的一切贸易政策不得改变，维多利亚也不得撤回对谢拉格的援助。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"否则，我们随时会中断与维多利亚的合作——这也不会是你们想要的局面。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"夫人，您实在是多虑了。与谢拉格的和平合作我们求之不得，又怎会主动破坏？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"当您成为谢拉格唯一的代言人之后，我们还有很多可以合作的空间。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"好......","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"不过想要取代喀兰贸易不是一朝一夕能够完成的，我们都需要时间准备......当务之急，就是先得摆平阿克托斯。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"以我对那个阿克托斯的了解，只要让他发现布朗陶和维多利亚合作，他一定会想办法再找我麻烦。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"某种程度上他比恩希欧迪斯更加棘手......","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"multiline","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"这个蠢货！","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"真是十分遗憾......","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"请布朗陶夫人决定吧。对于阿克托斯，我们该如何争取一下呢？","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我会再找阿克托斯，最后好好地“谈一次”。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"......哦？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"在领地西南的山脚下，布朗陶家还留有一个祖宅，附近几乎无人居住。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我会给阿克托斯传消息，以说明真相为由，约他明天到那里谈话。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"时间就定在晚上七点，也就是十五个小时后。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"希望......维多利亚能够证明自己的诚意。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2012_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"当然，不会让您失望的，夫人。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚大使","text":"我们也衷心地希望，您能够“说服”佩尔罗契家族。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_2012_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_bg_40_g2_glacier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$2","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":182},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":183,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0.8","loop":"true","channel":"wind","id":184},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reedmarshes","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":185},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":186},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lightsnow","layer":"1","id":187},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":189},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"山风夹杂雪沫，触响着屋檐的干草。","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"几片脆弱的枯叶被风卷起，飘往坐在屋顶的少女的发辫上，她捻下这些杂物，双指轻轻揉搓。","id":192},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$1","duration":"1.5","isCopy":"true","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"裂云兽从少女的肩后探出脑袋，碰了碰她通红的脸颊。","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$1","focus":"m","isCopy":"true","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"啊，裂云兽......","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","isCopy":"true","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我只想......坐在这里散散心，你不用陪我受冻。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"n","isCopy":"true","id":201},{"type":"text","text":"白色的小生灵发出“咕噜咕噜”的声音，它已经和茱安娜一起度过了无数难挨的日夜。","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","isCopy":"true","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"谢谢你......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$1","focus":"m","isCopy":"true","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我......不知道该怎么面对圣女......大人......","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"她是耶拉冈德的代行者，按理说我应该敬爱她，可——","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"为什么会发生那种事，为什么还要惩罚我们家......","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"少女将裂云兽拥入怀中，静静在屋顶上坐着，直到细密的雪花将她头发染上一层白。","id":212},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"wind","fadetime":"2","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"charslot","id":217},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_bg_67_G5_statueworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":219},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lightsnow","layer":"1","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"通往木屋后院的门被推开了。","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"来访者为后院的雪地新添了几处浅浅的脚印。恩雅走向左侧，她看见三把摆放凌乱的弩，拾起一把端详起来。","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"似乎要比茱安娜使用的弩小上一圈。","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅向前望去，不远处立着三个箭靶，还留着几支没有回收的弩箭。","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#2$1","duration":"0.7","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"这么小的年纪，就要开始训练了吗......","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"把手上还刻着名字......是她弟弟妹妹的吗？","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"院子另一头堆放的杂物此时吸引了恩雅的目光。那边空地上横七竖八地倒了一地雕像，但她仍一眼看见了雕像上令人怀念的面容。","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅走近其中最大的雕像，将它握举在身前。雕刻它的工匠，技术显然已经炉火纯青——耶拉冈德正对着恩雅，露出祂温和的微笑。","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"multiline","name":"恩雅","text":"这不是......","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"multiline","name":"恩雅","text":"和银心湖我们敲定的雕像差不多嘛。","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"看来你在大家心底都是这个样子呢。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"charslot","id":245},{"type":"text","text":"而脚边还有稍有不同的作品，恩雅又拿起一个。","id":246},{"type":"text","text":"新拿起的雕像纤细了一些，开脸也稍显粗糙，甚至让人觉得面目刻薄。多半是工匠在雕刻脸部时没掌握好力度，削得过头了。","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":250},{"type":"bgeffect","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_bg_45_g9_underkjerastastue.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_250_1#4$1","id":254},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":255},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"1","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":257},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_250_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅儿","text":"果然还是不太合适吧，和耶拉冈德根本不像！","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_250_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅儿","text":"至少脸也该再瘦一些，身材也......","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_250_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_250_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅儿","text":"圣女大人，也请听听您侍女小小的愿望吧。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_250_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_250_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅儿","text":"恩雅，好恩雅~","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_250_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_bg_67_G5_statueworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lightsnow","layer":"1","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"现在知道了吧？脸宽一点更好看。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"charslot","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"一大一小的两个雕像，被郑重地摆放了回去。","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"在荒凉而陌生的院子里，恩雅双手合十，如蔓珠院长老们那般，虔敬地面朝耶拉冈德的雕像。","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"她没有许下任何具体的愿望，她只是期待一个奇迹降临。","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"bgeffect","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_bg_67_G10_kjeragwilde_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":296,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"太阳已经落山，小猎手依然独自坐在院中。","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"看到恩雅，女孩连忙准备起身行礼，恩雅却紧紧按住了她的胳膊。","id":304},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......圣女大人。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"不用这样，反正又没有别人，我们就省略这些繁文缛节吧。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"另外，我还是希望你能叫我恩雅。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......听您吩咐。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"打完招呼，女孩又把头别到一边，不再言语。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"对了......我看到院子里有很多耶拉冈德的雕像，都是你们自己制作的吗？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"（沉默地点头）","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"而且，形象好像也不太相同，是因为大家对古籍中记载的耶拉冈德形象有不同的理解？","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"像的那些是爸爸雕的，不像的是我雕的......","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"噗嗤——","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"对不起......！不过我想问问，你们为什么要做这么多耶拉冈德的雕像？","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......在很久以前，我们家从佩尔罗契家分出来，按照耶拉冈德的指引进入雪山，从此祖祖辈辈都是猎人。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我们相信，山上的生命一同分有了耶拉冈德的灵魂，我们作为祂的一部分在此循环往复，生生不息。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"因感念耶拉冈德的恩赐，每个家族成员从能够独自狩猎开始，都需要学习制作耶拉冈德像。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"以及其他带有祂印记的皮衣、骨雕和摆件等等。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"“猎人有福，且听一言。”","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"“风行草偃，岂非祂之偈语？飞禽走兽，岂非祂之化物？”","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"“生灭循环，犹是冰水变换；未有始者，亦不有终。”","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"“独讲与你，耶拉冈德之智与爱。”","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"“不倚异兆，唯寻雪山”......然后，然后是——","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"“方能与祂共契。”","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"就是这段......它和《耶拉冈德》其他很多部分都不一样，我总是记一句忘一句。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"经书里的细枝末节没有那么重要。只需常常提醒自己，耶拉冈德在倾听和凝视着我们的言行。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"虽然背不通顺这些拗口的词句，但你在尽力生活。狩猎、雕刻，这一举一动都在恪守祂的教诲。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"即使是圣女......如果我没有遇到茱安娜，或许终己一生都无法真正通晓这一段落的要义。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"你是我所见过最虔诚的信徒之一，我知道，耶拉冈德会保佑你们一家幸福的。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"真是这样吗？","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"嗯，我可是祂......选中的圣女。我相信，无论多么艰难，祂都会显现在我们最需要的时刻。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"呜——","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"charslot","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"一向以坚强示人的小猎人，稚嫩的脸庞上淌下两行泪珠，掉落在她和恩雅的脚边。","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"茱安娜？发生什么事了？能和我说说吗？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我，我——","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"n","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅紧紧握住茱安娜失控颤抖的双手。","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我刚学会打猎的时候，被一头源石感染的野兽咬伤......得了矿石病......","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"为了给我治病......父亲他天天打完猎，回家还要加紧做那些雕像，拿去城里换点药......就这么一年一年......","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"前几天，父亲的朋友告诉我......天灾的那天，父亲他......就在车站......","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"如果不是我——","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"呜......呜啊......","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"茱安娜......","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"耶拉冈德，为什么......","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":384},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":386},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_bg_38_g21_skystarry_L2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"哀恸的少女坐倒在地，抱着膝盖蜷缩起来。","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅蹲伏在一旁，竭力构思着慰藉的言辞，但她的思绪掠尽经书也没有找出一句，伸出的手迟疑了一下，轻抚少女的后背。","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"她的喉咙哽咽发堵。如果永恒的耶拉冈德也会敛声息语，那祂的圣女又能做到什么呢？","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"雅儿，你在听吗......","id":392},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":394},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_bg_67_G10_kjeragwilde_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":396},{"type":"text","text":"“咕噜咕噜”，窗边的裂云兽像是看见什么，用它能发出的最大的动静喊叫着，一溜烟又跑回了茱安娜的兜帽里。","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"茱安娜吸了吸鼻子，用掌根匆匆擦去两颊的泪水。","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......院子外面有人来了，我去开门。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"好心的姑娘......","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"请问......最近的镇子该怎么走？","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"您是迷路了吗......您能从这里看见那边的灯光吗？您只要沿着这条路往山下走，遇到岔路口就向有灯的地方——","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"唉......天这么黑，我这眼睛不好使哟......","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"multiline","name":"茱安娜","text":"我来送——","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"multiline","name":"茱安娜","text":"不行......我还不能离开。","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"老爷爷，要不您在这里留住一晚，等天亮了再下山吧。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"charslot","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"算啦，算啦，不麻烦你啦。我还是自己摸索着下山吧......","id":418},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crutch_snow","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":420},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"3.5","channel":"nw","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"怎么了？","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"没事，就是一个迷路的老爷爷。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"你住在这么远离城镇的地方，平时经常有人路过吗？","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"只有我们一家住在这里，基本没见过什么路人，圣女大人您还是第一个......","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":434},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"——当心！","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"charslot","id":438},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","volume":"1","id":439},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrow","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"s1","delay":"0.3","id":440},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bowstring","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"s2","delay":"0.5","id":441},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bowstring_rebound","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"s3","delay":"0.6","id":442},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":443},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":444},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":449},{"type":"dialog","id":450},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":451},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":452},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":453},{"type":"charslot","id":454},{"type":"image","id":455}],"characters":["菈塔托丝","休露丝","维多利亚大使","茱安娜","恩雅","雅儿","路过的老人"]}